# Build context hygiene: the images only need sources, package manifests and edge
# templates. Everything below was being uploaded to the daemon on every build —
# node_modules alone makes the context hundreds of megabytes.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
data
backup
# docs/ is not needed at runtime, but the API's openapi.spec compares the live
# contract with the committed docs/openapi.json; ship only that file.
docs/*
!docs/openapi.json
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
Dockerfile*
